{"title":"만찬가","artist":"tuki","sourceId":"reference:C89StwnlXFvj0XPO4bGW","sourceHash":"59704cdcee661220d99ef5b6099bb0442b259a2ecfe66cb46cd886e283a3a9fa","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":9189797,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":9.64,"end":14.0,"text":"君を泣かすから だから一緒には居れないな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":14.0,"end":18.88,"text":"君を泣かすから 早く忘れて欲しいんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":18.88,"end":23.75,"text":"人間だからね たまには違うものも食べたいね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":23.75,"end":27.62,"text":"君を泣かすから そう君を泣かすから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":27.62,"end":30.4,"text":"でも味気ないんだよね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":30.4,"end":32.86,"text":"会いたくなんだよね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":32.86,"end":35.12,"text":"君以外会いたくないんだよね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":35.12,"end":37.07,"text":"なんて勝手だね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":37.07,"end":39.51,"text":"大体曖昧なんだよね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":39.51,"end":42.16,"text":"愛の存在証明なんて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":42.16,"end":46.38,"text":"君が教えてくれないか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":46.38,"end":51.69,"text":"何十回の夜を過ごしたって得られぬような","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":51.69,"end":55.67,"text":"愛してるを並べてみて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":55.67,"end":60.6,"text":"何十回の夜を過ごしたって得られぬような","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":60.6,"end":66.55,"text":"最高のフルコースを頂戴","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":74.53,"end":79.22,"text":"君を泣かすから きっと一生は無理だよね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":79.22,"end":83.91,"text":"君を泣かすから 胸がとても痛くなんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":83.91,"end":88.98,"text":"人間だからね たまには分かり合えなくなって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":88.98,"end":93.0,"text":"君を泣かすから また君を泣かすから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":93.0,"end":95.45,"text":"でも自信がないんだよね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":95.45,"end":98.05,"text":"変わりたくないんだよね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":98.05,"end":100.25,"text":"君以外会いたくないんだよね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":100.25,"end":102.65,"text":"なんて勝手だね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":102.65,"end":104.97999999999999,"text":"大体曖昧だったよね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":104.97999999999999,"end":107.32,"text":"愛の存在証明なんて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":107.32,"end":111.52000000000001,"text":"君がそこに居るのにね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":111.52000000000001,"end":116.72999999999999,"text":"何百回の夜を過ごしたって得られぬような","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":116.72999999999999,"end":120.88,"text":"愛してるを並べてみて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":120.88,"end":126.03,"text":"何百回の夜を過ごしたって得られぬような","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":126.03,"end":130.7,"text":"最高のフルコースを頂戴","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":130.7,"end":134.92,"text":"離れないで傍に居てくれたのは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":134.92,"end":139.63,"text":"結局君一人だったよね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":139.63,"end":144.48,"text":"涙のスパイスは君の胸に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":144.48,"end":148.87,"text":"残ってしまうだろうけど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":148.87,"end":154.05,"text":"何千回の夜を過ごしたって得られぬような","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":154.05,"end":158.2,"text":"愛してるを並べるから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":158.2,"end":163.32999999999998,"text":"何千回の夜を過ごしたって得られぬような","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":163.32999999999998,"end":167.77,"text"